  "description": "SignalR-based real-time communication for the GM.* ecosystem. IRealTimeSender pushes to users/connections/groups without touching IHubContext directly; a presence-tracking hub registers connections in a shared, lock-guarded registry (GM.Caching + GM.DistributedLock); and the WebSocket handshake reads the JWT from the access_token query string (pairs with GM.Identity). One call: AddGMRealTime().",
